        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    net_income = 1_500_000\n    common_shares_outstanding = 1_000_000\n    convertible_shares = 300_000\n    bond_par_value = 10_000_000\n    bond_coupon_rate = 0.04\n    preferred_stock_par_value = 2_000_000\n    preferred_dividend_rate = 0.07\n    tax_rate = 0.30\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    preferred_dividends = preferred_stock_par_value * preferred_dividend_rate\n    interest_on_bonds = bond_par_value * bond_coupon_rate\n    after_tax_interest = interest_on_bonds * (1 - tax_rate)\n\n    adjusted_net_income = (\n        net_income - preferred_dividends + after_tax_interest\n    )\n    total_shares = common_shares_outstanding + convertible_shares\n    diluted_eps = adjusted_net_income / total_shares\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(diluted_eps, 3)\n```",
